      "value": "Frequently Asked Questions"
    },
    "description": [
      {
        "value": "Common questions about Thesis Guidance"
      }
    ],
    "items": [
      {
        "q": "Does WRIRK write my thesis?",
        "a": "No. WRIRK provides research guidance and mentorship. We do not write your thesis for you. Our experts guide you, explain research concepts, review your work, and provide constructive feedback."
      },
      {
        "q": "What areas of thesis work do you provide guidance on?",
        "a": "We provide guidance across different stages of research, including research topic, problem statement, objectives, literature review, methodology, data analysis, interpretation, results, formatting, and thesis structure."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I get guidance for a specific thesis chapter?",
        "a": "Yes. You can discuss specific chapters, sections, or research challenges where you need expert guidance."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can you help me prepare for my thesis defense?",
        "a": "Yes. We can provide guidance to help you understand your research, explain your methodology and findings, and prepare to discuss your research during your thesis defense."
      }
    ]
